# Keep the agent image slim and secret-free. Only schema.sql + everlink/ + scripts/ +
# requirements.txt are COPYed in (see Dockerfile); everything below is excluded from the
# build context so it can never leak into a layer.

# --- VCS / editor / CI ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.idea
.vscode
.qoder

# --- the Next.js board deploys SEPARATELY to Vercel; never build it into the agent image ---
board

# --- tests + local eval/telemetry artifacts (not needed at runtime) ---
tests
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
runs
otel-*.json
*.sqlite
*.db

# --- SECRETS: never ship a real .env into an image (platform injects env vars) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
aws_credentials*
credentials.json

# --- data snapshots: slots_*.csv ARE shipped (first-party Scanner read-only input,
# baked into this PRIVATE image); raw *.jsonl dumps stay out. ---
data/*.csv
!data/slots_*.csv
data/*.jsonl

# --- python bytecode / packaging ---
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.venv
venv

# --- docs + local scratch (not needed to RUN the agent) ---
*.md
LICENSE
_*
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
railway.json
railway.toml
SUBMISSION_CHECKLIST.md
